+## 3.2.1 — Whisper Keystore hotfix
+
+- Fixes Whisper preparation failing on Android Keystore with `Caller-provided IV not permitted`.
+- Letterbox now lets Android Keystore generate a fresh AES-GCM IV and stores it in a versioned local envelope.
+- Keeps read compatibility with the previous local Letterbox format.
+
 # Changelog
 
